  (wire (pts (xy 439.42 359.41) (xy 444.5 359.41)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "e308c892-54e6-50dc-8fa6-3ba85cceff29"))
  (text "NMR RX (section A) — clocks, tuned tank, LNA, blanking, I/Q commutating mixer, IF" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1f2f6ffc-1a1e-531d-a0b0-3a8ceb7cbc7c"))
  (text "Design coil: 400 turns AWG26, 4 cm x 10 cm, L = 2.53 mH, R_DC = 6.7 R. Tuned with 1.25 nF at f_Larmor = 89.4 kHz (B0 = 2.1 mT): X_L = 1419 R, R_p = Q*X_L = 14.2 kOhm at Q = 10, tank noise 15.3 nV/rtHz, signal 40 uV pk (v0.7 NMR circuits doc section 0)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1b2695d8-e51a-53d9-afdd-e990ff8410fd"))
  (text "LNA: the source impedance is 14.2 kOhm, so CURRENT noise decides. OPA1656 (FET, 6 fA/rtHz) gives NF = 0.15 dB; the OPA1612 (1.7 pA/rtHz) would cost 5.5 dB = 3.5x more averages. Gain 101 x 10 = 1000 puts 40 mV pk at the mixer and 1.02 V pk on the ADC (section 3.2 / 4.3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "64f5c58c-f086-5375-b000-bc1923f83249"))
  (text "Blanking sits BETWEEN the stages: 60 pC of DG419 charge injection lands on C720 = 10 nF as 6 mV, not on the 1.25 nF tank as 48 mV. Interstage coupling 10 nF / 10 k = 1.59 kHz, so the receiver recovers in 0.3 ms instead of the 300 ms a 1 uF / 100 k would need (section 3.3). RX_BLANK: 0 = blanked (default, 10 k pull-down R724), 1 = receive — an un-driven GPIO leaves the receiver blanked." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "328a5d60-0ae6-57db-9451-0ba136eede32"))
  (text "Quadrature LO: the Si5351 phase register cannot do 90 deg below 4.72 MHz (PHOFF is 7 bit in units of T_VCO/4, AN619 section 6). U702 is a 2-bit Johnson counter on CLK1 = 4*f_LO: FF1 D = /Q2, FF2 D = Q1 -> LO_I and LO_Q exactly 90 deg apart at any frequency (section 1.4). Pulse /CLR after every PLLB change so the counter always starts in state 00." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8af84063-39f6-5db7-83d9-35f62794b420"))
  (text "Mixer supply is +3V3A, NOT +5VA: the TS5A23157 needs V_IH = 0.7*V+ = 3.5 V at 5 V, which a 3.3 V CMOS LO never meets; at 3.3 V it is 2.31 V with 1.0 V of margin (section 4.1). FB901 + 10 uF + 100 nF make +3V3A from +3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 31.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e6c7405-1f7e-5603-b68b-7019fdb1e901"))
  (text "Double-balanced commutator: U901 switches S+/S- into COM (I+ and Q+), U902 the same with the inputs swapped (I- and Q-). The difference amplifiers (G = 20, 0.1 % thin film -> CMRR 54 dB) reject V_MID and the LO-synchronous charge injection; the reference leg returns to AGND so COND_OUT1/2 are centred on 0 V for the ADC's +-5.12 V range (section 4.2)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c97dc0c0-f4d0-5f67-a9f3-abe7904a6585"))
  (text "Grounding (section 8): everything analog on AGND, including U702 (which runs from +3V3A) and the switches, so the commutation instants share the signal ground. The Si5351 is on GND; the single line that crosses is CLK1, damped by R704 / C706. AGND meets GND only at NT1 on the base sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 38.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5cbe2d26-ab1a-553f-abb6-7ad36e778909"))
  (text "1 — CLOCKS: Si5351A (I2C 0x60) + 74HC74 Johnson quadrature divider" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 56 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ab226e3f-0861-56aa-aef9-1fc4f2a445a0"))
  (text "C9006 is a 12 pF crystal: XTAL_CL = 10 pF internal + 4 pF on each of XA/XB = 2 pF external" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 143 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "602cc605-7faf-52cd-bae1-ee1b06601cae"))
  (text "U702 = 74HC74D,653 dual D flip-flop as a 2-bit Johnson counter. Pins: 1/13 /CLR, 2/12 D, 3/11 CLK," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 143 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fe1a4599-8e4a-5790-afae-c27d48239e6d"))
  (text "4/10 /PRE, 5/9 Q, 6/8 /Q, 7 GND, 14 VCC. States 00 -> 10 -> 11 -> 01: LO_Q lags LO_I by exactly 90 deg." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 146.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "971f1cba-d258-5cc6-b39d-12d5091c0382"))
  (text "+3V3A — analog 3.3 V for U702 / U901 / U902 (section 4.1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 235 63 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d12bb49d-fd9c-5f14-ae70-b881cbd3b1c9"))
  (text "CLK2 = spare clock / scope trigger" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 285 110 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2306deb6-919e-5e2e-9831-2abde413de22"))
  (text "Decoupling: C703/C704 VDD, C705 VDDO (Si5351, GND); C707 U702, C906/C907/C908 +3V3A (AGND);" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 350 52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "61b37584-ebc7-5353-b104-7e0390f0eaff"))
  (text "C722-C727 U703/U704 +-12 V, C916-C919 U705/U706 +-12 V (all AGND). C905 = 10 uF on +3V3A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 350 55.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b5d04af2-1334-514d-b5bd-f5dbdd6f68ed"))
  (text "2 — RECEIVER: crossed-diode limiter, tuned tank, OPA1656 x1000, DG419 blanking" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 170 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4b4e8183-ebc4-516f-95a5-0ac0a4cd1a98"))
  (text "RX = link pin 37 (panel SMA, receive coil). D703/D704 and their AGND return sit within 5 mm of the pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 178 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "60ac08ce-fcf3-5104-ad7d-0df67a1c2402"))
  (text "Stage 1: G = 1 + R712/R713 = 1 + 10 000/100 = 101" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 78 214 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb0f8ce2-c626-58d1-9f9a-27e0e87fd90e"))
  (text "Stage 2: G = 1 + R722/R723 = 1 + 9090/1000 = 10.0" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 78 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1045c27e-3d41-5803-bfce-969c450165c6"))
  (text "DG419: logic 0 -> SW1 on, so RX_BLANK = 0 ties the stage-2 input (D) to AGND = BLANKED." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205 232 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4cc4f533-a732-5145-b5ef-31bd7a406103"))
  (text "VL = +5VA (V_IH = 2.4 V, so a 3.3 V CMOS drive has 0.9 V of margin); V+/V- = +-12 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205 235.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "17c9e026-05d0-5034-b451-bdd97effe286"))
  (text "RX_BLANK: 0 = blanked (default, 10 k pull-down), 1 = receive." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205 241 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4cbce79d-3fe6-525d-b281-43fd66e10b42"))
  (text "R724 goes to AGND, not to +3V3 as the design document's netlist table says: logic 0 blanks, so only a" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205 244.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5a38b345-edce-52e3-9b2e-eab5226d6b95"))
  (text "pull-DOWN gives the blanked-by-default the same document asks for in section 3.3 (instructor, 2026-09-13)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205 247.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "059892e7-5189-5b54-b780-5c721850cc0e"))
  (text "JP701: AUX -> LNA input (1-2), or AUX to AGND (2-3). Open by default." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 288 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ae995aca-ba26-5cb9-80d2-cecff1a80ac4"))
  (text "JP702: stage-1 feedback select. 1-2 bridged (default) = R712, G = 101; cut and bridge 2-3 = R714, G = 11." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 288 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb43aec4-7084-5c7b-85a0-876e6e4f82be"))
  (text "JP703 is in series with the R723 ground leg: cut it and stage 2 becomes a unity follower (G = 1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 265 291.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "94bef65f-b02b-56e3-beb6-bc20b8a25663"))
  (text "Tank: C710 1.2 nF + C711 100 pF + C712 22 pF = 1.322 nF of pads; stuff to the 1.25 nF the coil needs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "611449ce-c35c-5370-b21d-cc50d3ce131f"))
  (text "Preferred practice is to tune AT THE COIL: 1 m of RG174 adds ~100 pF = 8 % detune." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340 175.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a51b9707-ec0d-510a-beda-5fd85663e201"))
  (text "3 — I/Q COMMUTATING MIXER AND IF (9xx): double-balanced, both switch packages used" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 297 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "641a0c1e-1d15-5cf5-b157-e74b99a150ed"))
